# In a Pickle (windurst 5) at GIL_RATE 1.0625 (exact in binary; setting <NAME> <decimal>, quest rework P5): 200 x
# 1.0625 = 212.5, a product that ends in exactly one half, so the rounding shows. 659 pays through npcUtil.giveCurrency
# (200 x GIL_RATE with GIL_OBTAINED: 213); 662's argument is the literal 200 and it pays addGil(GIL_RATE x 200) (the
# engine's integral getter, llround: 213; a truncation would give 212), no message. Accepted (a GM); one stone at a
# time (rare, stack 1: a GM gives each); the draws as the seed plays them after the colon.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-69.0,-3.8,-4.4 job=WAR lvl=75
setting GIL_RATE 1.0625
quest Windurst.InAPickle accepted
login
item SmoothStone
trade Chamama SmoothStone x1            # accepted: 659 / 657 / 658: 659
finish                                  # 213 gil by giveCurrency, GIL_OBTAINED 213; completed
item SmoothStone
trade Chamama SmoothStone x1            # completed: 662 / 657 / 658: 657
finish
item SmoothStone
trade Chamama SmoothStone x1            # 662 (200)
finish                                  # 213 gil (addGil), no message
